<title>NORWAY: Norway expands T-bill by 12 billion crowns.</title>
<headline>Norway expands T-bill by 12 billion crowns.</headline>
<dateline>OSLO 1996-12-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Norway's central bank said on Monday the Finance Ministry was expanding the SS42 treasury bill by 12 billion crowns.</p>
<p>The amount will be issued at an ad hoc auction with final date for tenders at 0900 GMT on Thursday. Settlement is two days later. The bill was issued on March 14 with a nominal interest rate of 4.70 percent. It matures on March 19, 1997.</p>
<p>--Oslo newsroom +47 22 42 50 41</p>
</text>
